From df28fe6da82288bf19fcaf54fc04077f581fea57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: User-3090 <71881005+User-3090@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 07:40:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(windows): harden package, installer, and update
 handling

Produce deterministic ConPTY package archives, keep installer staging paths short for Windows PowerShell 5.1, normalize vendor patch inventory paths, and centralize herdr-win preview distribution sources so local and nightly builds cannot fall back to upstream while reusing Herdr update mechanics.
